{"page":166,"verses":[{"verse_key":"7:131","surah":7,"ayah":131,"ar_uthmani":"فَإِذَا جَآءَتْهُمُ ٱلْحَسَنَةُ قَالُوا۟ لَنَا هَـٰذِهِۦ ۖ وَإِن تُصِبْهُمْ سَيِّئَةٌ يَطَّيَّرُوا۟ بِمُوسَىٰ وَمَن مَّعَهُۥٓ ۗ أَلَآ إِنَّمَا طَـٰٓئِرُهُمْ عِندَ ٱللَّهِ وَلَـٰكِنَّ أَكْثَرَهُمْ لَا يَعْلَمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"then, when something good came their way, they said, ‘This is our due!’. When something bad came, they ascribed it to the evil omen of Moses and those with him, but their ‘evil omen’ was really from God, though most of them did not realize it.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَإِذَا","en_gloss":"But when","transliteration":"fa-idhā","verse_key":"7:131"},{"pos":2,"ar":"جَآءَتْهُمُ","en_gloss":"came to them","transliteration":"jāathumu","verse_key":"7:131"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْحَسَنَةُ","en_gloss":"the good","transliteration":"l-ḥasanatu","verse_key":"7:131"},{"pos":4,"ar":"قَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"they said","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"7:131"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لَنَا","en_gloss":"For us","transliteration":"lanā","verse_key":"7:131"},{"pos":6,"ar":"هَـٰذِهِۦ ۖ","en_gloss":"(is) this","transliteration":"hādhihi","verse_key":"7:131"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَإِن","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"wa-in","verse_key":"7:131"},{"pos":8,"ar":"تُصِبْهُمْ","en_gloss":"afflicts them","transliteration":"tuṣib'hum","verse_key":"7:131"},{"pos":9,"ar":"سَيِّئَةٌۭ","en_gloss":"bad","transliteration":"sayyi-atun","verse_key":"7:131"},{"pos":10,"ar":"يَطَّيَّرُوا۟","en_gloss":"they ascribe evil omens","transliteration":"yaṭṭayyarū","verse_key":"7:131"},{"pos":11,"ar":"بِمُوسَىٰ","en_gloss":"to Musa","transliteration":"bimūsā","verse_key":"7:131"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَمَن","en_gloss":"and who","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"7:131"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مَّعَهُۥٓ ۗ","en_gloss":"(were) with him","transliteration":"maʿahu","verse_key":"7:131"},{"pos":14,"ar":"أَلَآ","en_gloss":"Behold","transliteration":"alā","verse_key":"7:131"},{"pos":15,"ar":"إِنَّمَا","en_gloss":"Only","tra