_gloss":"we","transliteration":"naḥnu","verse_key":"7:132"},{"pos":11,"ar":"لَكَ","en_gloss":"(will be) in you","transliteration":"laka","verse_key":"7:132"},{"pos":12,"ar":"بِمُؤْمِنِينَ","en_gloss":"believers","transliteration":"bimu'minīna","verse_key":"7:132"},{"pos":13,"ar":"١٣٢","en_gloss":"(132)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"7:132"}]},{"verse_key":"7:133","surah":7,"ayah":133,"ar_uthmani":"فَأَرْسَلْنَا عَلَيْهِمُ ٱلطُّوفَانَ وَٱلْجَرَادَ وَٱلْقُمَّلَ وَٱلضَّفَادِعَ وَٱلدَّمَ ءَايَـٰتٍ مُّفَصَّلَـٰتٍ فَٱسْتَكْبَرُوا۟ وَكَانُوا۟ قَوْمًا مُّجْرِمِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"and so We let loose on them the flood, locusts, lice, frogs, blood- all clear signs. They were arrogant, wicked people.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَأَرْسَلْنَا","en_gloss":"So We sent","transliteration":"fa-arsalnā","verse_key":"7:133"},{"pos":2,"ar":"عَلَيْهِمُ","en_gloss":"on them","transliteration":"ʿalayhimu","verse_key":"7:133"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلطُّوفَانَ","en_gloss":"the flood","transliteration":"l-ṭūfāna","verse_key":"7:133"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَٱلْجَرَادَ","en_gloss":"and the locusts","transliteration":"wal-jarāda","verse_key":"7:133"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَٱلْقُمَّلَ","en_gloss":"and the lice","transliteration":"wal-qumala","verse_key":"7:133"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَٱلضَّفَادِعَ","en_gloss":"and the frogs","transliteration":"wal-ḍafādiʿa","verse_key":"7:133"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَٱلدَّمَ","en_gloss":"and the blood","transliteration":"wal-dama","verse_key":"7:133"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ءَايَـٰتٍۢ","en_gloss":"(as) signs","transliteration":"āyātin","verse_key":"7:133"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مُّفَصَّلَـٰتٍۢ","en_gloss":"manifest","transliteration":"mufaṣṣalātin","verse_key":"7:133"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فَٱسْتَكْبَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"but they showed arrogance","transliteration":"fa-is'takbarū","verse_key":"7:133"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَكَانُوا۟","en_gloss":"and they were","transliteration":"wakānū","verse_key":"7:133"},{"pos":12,"ar":"قَوْمًۭا","en_gloss":"a people","transliteration":"qawman","verse_key":"7:133"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مُّجْرِمِينَ","en_gloss":"criminal","transliteration":"muj'rimīna","verse_key":"7:133"},{"pos":14,"ar":"١٣٣","en_gloss":"(133)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"7:133"}]},{"verse_key":"7:134","surah":7,"ayah":134,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَمَّا وَقَعَ عَلَيْهِمُ ٱلرِّجْزُ قَالُوا۟ يَـٰمُوسَى ٱدْعُ لَنَا رَبَّكَ بِمَا عَهِدَ عِندَكَ ۖ لَئِن كَشَفْتَ عَنَّا ٱلرِّجْزَ لَنُؤْمِنَنَّ لَكَ وَلَنُرْسِلَنَّ مَعَكَ بَنِىٓ إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They would say, whenever a plague struck them, ‘Moses, pray to your Lord for us by virtue of the promise He has made to you: if you relieve us of the plague, we will believe you and let the Children of Israel go with you,’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَمَّا","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"walammā","verse_key":"7:134"},{"pos":2,"ar":"وَقَعَ","en_gloss":"fell","transliteration":"waqaʿa","verse_key":"7:134"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عَلَيْهِمُ","en_gloss":"on them","transliteration":"ʿalayhimu","verse_key":"7:134"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلرِّجْزُ","en_gloss":"the punishment","transliteration":"l-rij'zu","verse_key":"7:134"},{"pos":5,"ar":"قَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"they said","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"7:134"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يَـٰمُوسَى","en_gloss":"O Musa","transliteration":"yāmūsā","verse_key":"7:134"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱدْعُ","en_gloss":"Invoke","transliteration":"ud'ʿu","verse_key":"7:134"},{"pos":8,"ar":"لَنَا","en_gloss":"for us","transliteration":"lanā","verse_key":"7:134"},{"pos":9,"ar":"رَبَّكَ","en_gloss":"your Lord","transliteration":"rabbaka","verse_key":"7:134"},{"pos":10,"ar":"بِمَا","en_gloss":"by what","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"7:134"},{"pos":11,"ar":"عَهِدَ","en_gloss":"He has promised","transliteration":"ʿahida","verse_key":"7:134"},{"pos":12,"ar":"عِندَكَ ۖ","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"ʿindaka","verse_key":"7:134"},{"pos":13,"ar":"لَئِن","en_gloss":"If","transliteration":"la-in","verse_key":"7:134"},{"pos":14,"ar":"كَشَفْتَ","en_gloss":"you remove","transliteration":"kashaft